'''Dante Goon''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears as a {{Legendary}} [[The Garden#Visitors|Visitor]] in [[The Garden]]. They require {{Skill|Garden|12}} unlocked to visit, as well as having interacted with {{NPCSprite|Dante}}'s grave in the {{Zone|Graveyard}}.

